SUSPECTED BUG (precision; plan step S09 not built yet): a static call of
the adapter HandlerFunc.Handle on a closure literal can only return
main.errQuota. Actual: every closure that is ever converted to HandlerFunc
is a Candidate of f(e) (5 of 5), so the set also holds the middleware
errors and wraps. With the default -chain-depth the same query prints 1093
entries (24k lines), hence -chain-depth=1 here.
-- args --
-chain-depth=1 main.go:@quota_call
